Template: radioberry/fpga
Type: select
Choices: CL025, CL016
Default: CL025
Description: FPGA on the RadioBerry:
 The RadioBerry 2.x carries an Intel Cyclone 10 LP FPGA, a 10CL025 or a
 10CL016; the marking on the chip's package says which (10CL025YE144C8G or
 10CL016YE144C8G). The gateware for the FPGA chosen here becomes
 /usr/lib/firmware/radioberry.rbf, which the driver loads at boot.
 .
 To change it later: dpkg-reconfigure radioberry
